# Freeze before evaluation; internal, not an external blinded benchmark.
# Learner receives only shape/actions, never hidden control definitions.
# Same declared rule family: 3..6 bits, 2..8 actions, <=2 guard literals,
# toggle <=2 bits, assign one bit or noop. Deterministic resettable simulator.
# Every policy uses the same hypothesis family and an intervention cap of 512.
# Per identified world: exhaustive transition audit, 32 rollout-derived targets,
# 8 arbitrary targets, independently computed shortest paths/unreachability.
# The audit is after training, not training evidence; account separately.
# No tuning on these seeds. Development uses seed=317031 worlds=24.
